cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use quick_synteny, please cite it as below."
title: quick_synteny
abstract: >-
  Whole-genome synteny plots based on alignment of protein-coding genes.
  quick_synteny aligns one proteome to two genome assemblies with miniprot
  and chains the matches into syntenic blocks, finding a reference genome
  and proteome on NCBI from a taxid when none is given.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dias
    given-names: Guilherme
repository-code: "https://github.com/gbdias/quick_synteny"
keywords:
  - synteny
  - comparative genomics
  - genome assembly
  - nextflow
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
